ture":false},{"text":"\t// Apply global error handling middleware (before signature verification)","lineNumber":53,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\trouter.Use(middleware.ErrorHandler())","lineNumber":54,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":55,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t// Health check endpoint (no authentication required)","lineNumber":56,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\trouter.GET(\"/health\", handleHealth)","lineNumber":57,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":58,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t// Apply signature verification and idempotency middleware to webhook endpoint","lineNumber":59,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\trouter.POST(webhookPath,","lineNumber":60,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\tmiddleware.VerifyWebhookSignature(),","lineNumber":61,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\tmiddleware.IdempotencyMiddleware(),","lineNumber":62,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\thandleGitHubWebhook)","lineNumber":63,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":64,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t// APIルート (Bearer認証)","lineNumber":65,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\trouter.POST(\"/api/agent-runs/:id/report\",","lineNumber":66,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\tmiddleware.VerifyBearerToken(),","lineNumber":67,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\thandlers.HandleAgentReport)","lineNumber":68,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":69,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\treturn router","lineNumber":70,"isSignature":false},{"text":"}","lineNumber":71,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":72,"isSignature":false},{"text":"// handleHealth handles GET /health requests","lineNumber":73,"isSignature":false},{"text":"// Returns server health status, database connectivity, uptime, and version","lineNumber":74,"isSignature":false},{"text":"func handleHealth(c *gin.Context) {","lineNumber":75,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\tlogger := config.GetLogger()","lineNumber":76,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.3158433437347412},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/contracts/github-webhooks.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":0,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":86,"column":0}},"contents":"# GitHub Webhooks Contract\n\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n**Last Updated**: 2025-10-31\n\n## Overview\n\nThis document defines the contract for GitHub webhook events consumed by the GitHub Agent Automation system. All webhooks are received at the `/webhooks/github` endpoint and verified using the GitHub App webhook secret.\n\n## Webhook Endpoint\n\n```\nPOST /webhooks/github\nContent-Type: application/json\nX-GitHub-Delivery: <unique-delivery-id>\nX-GitHub-Event: <event-type>\nX-Hub-Signature-256: sha256=<signature>\n```\n\n## Event Types\n\n### 1. issue_comment (FR-001, FR-010)\n\nTriggered when a comment is created on an Issue or PR.\n\n**Purpose**: Detect `/run-agent` trigger and `@codex review` requests\n\n**Webhook Payload** (relevant fields):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"created\",\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"id\": 123456,\n    \"number\": 42,\n    \"title\": \"Add new feature\",\n    \"body\": \"Description of the feature...\",\n    \"state\": \"open\",\n    \"labels\": [\n      { \"name\": \"enhancement\" }\n    ],\n    \"user\": {\n      \"login\": \"octocat\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"comment\": {\n    \"id\": 789012,\n    \"body\": \"/run-agent\",\n    \"user\": {\n      \"login\": \"octocat\"\n    },\n    \"created_at\": \"2025-10-31T12:00:00Z\"\n  },\n  \"repository\": {\n    \"full_name\": \"octocat/hello-world\",\n    \"owner\": {\n      \"login\": \"octocat\"\n    },\n    \"name\": \"hello-world\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Processing**:\n\n1. Check if `comment.body` contains `/run-agent` (case-insensitive)\n2. Verify `comment.user` has Collaborator+ permission (AuthorizationService)\n3. Extract X-GitHub-Delivery header for idempotency\n4. Create AgentRun with state=queued\n5. Trigger AgentExecutionService\n6. Log to AuditLog\n\n**Edge Cases**:\n- Comment edited: Ignore (only process `action: created`)\n- Comment on closed Issue: Reject with GitHub comment\n- Duplicate delivery ID: Return 200 OK, skip processing\n- User lacks permission: Post GitHub comment with error\n\n---\n\n### 2. issues (FR-013)\n\nTriggered when an Issue is opened, closed, or reopened.\n\n**Purpose**: Detect dependency graph changes and trigger unblocked tasks","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"# GitHub Webhooks Contract","lineNumber":1,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":2,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Version**: 1.0.0","lineNumber":3,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Last Updated**: 2025-10-31","lineNumber":4,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":5,"isSignature":false},{"text":"## Overview","lineNumber":6,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":7,"isSignature":false},{"text":"This document defines the contract for GitHub webhook events consumed by the GitHub Agent Automation system. All webhooks are received at the `/webhooks/github` endpoint and verified using the GitHub App webhook secret.","lineNumber":8,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":9,"isSignature":false},{"text":"## Webhook Endpoint","lineNumber":10,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":11,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":12,"isSignature":false},{"text":"POST /webhooks/github","lineNumber":13,"isSignature":false},{"text":"Content-Type: application/json","lineNumber":14,"isSignature":false},{"text":"X-GitHub-Delivery: <unique-delivery-id>","lineNumber":15,"isSignature":false},{"text":"X-GitHub-Event: <event-type>","lineNumber":16,"isSignature":false},{"text":"X-Hub-Signature-256: sha256=<signature>","lineNumber":17,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":18,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":19,"isSignature":false},{"text":"## Event Types","lineNumber":20,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":21,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### 1. issue_comment (FR-001, FR-010)","lineNumber":22,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":23,"isSignature":false},{"text":"Triggered wh