xt":"- Require manual reset via CLI: `operator retry <run-id> --reset-count`","lineNumber":387,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":388,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":389,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":390,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### 2. Partial Success (Lint Passed, CI Failed Later)","lineNumber":391,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":392,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Problem**: Should retry count include partial successes?","lineNumber":393,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":394,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Answer**: Yes, any failure triggers +1 increment","lineNumber":395,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":396,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Reason**: The goal is to reach fully working code, not partial progress","lineNumber":397,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":398,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":399,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":400,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### 3. Codex Never Responds","lineNumber":401,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":402,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Problem**: PR created, but Codex bot never posts review","lineNumber":403,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":404,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Action**:","lineNumber":405,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Spec requires **manual intervention** (FR-010 clarification)","lineNumber":406,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- System does NOT poll for Codex response","lineNumber":407,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.37353938817977905},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/tasks.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":198,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":229,"column":0}},"contents":"- [x] T096 [US3] Implement retry orchestrator managing retry_count (max 50) in internal/services/retry_orchestrator.go\n- [x] T097 [US3] Create feedback aggregator combining review + CI results in internal/services/feedback_aggregator.go\n- [x] T098 [U