*Review feedback received** (Codex review without approval)\n   - Extract review comments from GitHub PR\n   - Combine with CI status\n   - Pass aggregated feedback to AI\n   - Increment retry_count +1\n\n**Same Error Detection**:\n- Hash of (agent error + CI logs + review feedback)\n- If hash matches previous 3 consecutive attempts: notify user, pause auto-retry\n- User can manually reset via CLI: `agent-automation retry <run-id> --reset-count`\n\n**Retry Context Aggregation**:\n```json\n{\n  \"previous_attempts\": [\n    {\n      \"attempt\": 1,\n      \"agent_error\": \"Lint failed: missing semicolon\",\n      \"ci_logs\": \"Error at line 42: Expected ';'\",\n      \"review_comments\": [\"Missing type annotation for variable 'foo'\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"attempt\": 2,\n      \"agent_error\": null,\n      \"ci_logs\": \"Tests failed: parser_test.ts:12\",\n      \"review_comments\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total_retries\": 2,\n  \"max_retries\": 50\n}\n```\n\n**50 Retries Reached**:\n- Set AgentRun.state = `failed`\n- Post GitHub Issue comment: \"❌ Maximum retry limit (50) reached. Manual intervention required.\"\n- Send Discord notification (embed with error history)\n- Stop auto-retry loop","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"started ──[retry_count >= 50 OR unrecoverable error]──> failed","lineNumber":284,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":285,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":286,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Validation**:","lineNumber":287,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- retry_count incremented on each AI retry (CI failure or review feedback)","lineNumber":288,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Max 50 retries enforced by RetryOrchestrator","lineNumber":289,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- state=succeeded requires pr_id to be non-null AND PR.status=merged","lineNumber":290,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Automatic Discord + GitHub notification on state transition to failed","lineNumber":291,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":292,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Retry Logic Details","lineNumber":293,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":294,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Retry Interval**: Event-driven (no artificial delay between retries)","lineNumber":295,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":296,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Retry Triggers**:","lineNumber":297,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. **Agent execution failed** (agent-runner reports failure)","lineNumber":298,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Extract error logs from agent-runner report","lineNumber":299,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Pass error context to next AI attempt","lineNumber":300,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Increment retry_count +1","lineNumber":301,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":302,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. **CI failure detected** (via check_suite webhook)","lineNumber":303,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Extract CI logs from GitHub API","lineNumber":304,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Parse failure reasons (test failures, build errors)","lineNumber":305,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Aggregate with review feedback if any","lineNumber":306,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Increment retry_count +1","lineNumber":307,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":308,"isSignature":false},{"text":"3. **Review feedback received** (Codex review without approval)","lineNumber":309,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Extract review comments from GitHub PR","lineNumber":310,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Combine with CI status","lineNumber":311,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Pass aggregated feedback to AI","lineNumber":312,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Increment retry_count +1","lineNumber":313,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":314,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Same Error Detection**:","lineNumber":315,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Hash of (agent error + CI logs + review feedback)","lineNumber":316,"isSignature":false},{"text":