rigger**: Transient network/API failures","lineNumber":108,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":109,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Scenarios**:","lineNumber":110,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- GitHub API rate limit exceeded (HTTP 429)","lineNumber":111,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- GitHub API server error (HTTP 5xx)","lineNumber":112,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- GitHub API timeout (connection timeout)","lineNumber":113,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Network partition (connection refused)","lineNumber":114,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Operator API unreachable (agent-runner → Operator report call)","lineNumber":115,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- S3 connection failure (session upload/download failures)","lineNumber":116,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":117,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Action**:","lineNumber":118,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. **Do NOT** increment `AgentRun.retry_count`","lineNumber":119,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. Apply exponential backoff with jitter:","lineNumber":120,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Attempt 1: immediate","lineNumber":121,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.3149559497833252},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/contracts/agent-runner-detail.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":708,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":753,"column":0}},"contents":"| 0 | Success (report sent to Operator) |\n| 1 | Failure (any step failed, report sent) |\n\n### Error Scenarios\n\n1. **Git Clone Failed**: Report failure with error message\n2. **Agent Execution Failed**: Report with agent stderr/stdout\n3. **No File Changes**: Report failure \"No changes detected\"\n4. **Lint Failed**: Report with lint output\n5. **Type Check Failed**: Report with typecheck output\n6. **Git Push Failed**: Report with git error\n7. **PR Creation Failed**: Report with GitHub API error\n8. **Operator API Unreachable**: Retry 5 times, then exit 1\n9. **S3 Upload Failed**: Retry 5 times with exponential backoff, then exit 1\n10. **S3 Download Failed** (on retry): Retry 5 times with exponential backoff, then exit 1\n\n---\n\n## Testing\n\n### Unit Tests\n\n- `pkg/agent/executor_test.go` - Mock agent CLI execution\n- `pkg/lint/runner_test.go` - Mock npm commands\n- `pkg/git/operations_test.go` - Mock git commands\n- `pkg/reporter/client_test.go` - Mock HTTP requests\n\n### Integration Tests\n\n- End-to-end test with mock repository\n- Test full workflow: clone → agent → lint → commit → push → PR → report\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [Claude Code CLI Reference](https://docs.claude.com/ja/docs/claude-code/cli-reference)\n- [Cursor Headless CLI](https://cursor.com/ja/docs/cli/headless)\n- [ai-agent-execution.md](./ai-agent-execution.md) - Operator contract\n- [internal-api.yaml](./internal-api.yaml) - Report API specification\n\n---\n\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n**Last Updated**: 2025-11-01","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"| 0 | Success (report sent to Operator) |","lineNumber":709,"isSignature":false},{"text":"| 1 | Failure (any step failed, report sent) |","lineNumber":710,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":711,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Error Scenarios","lineNumber":712,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":713,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. **Git Clone Failed**: Report failure with error message","lineNumber":714,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. **Agent Execution Failed**: Report with agent stderr/stdout","lineNumber":715,"isSignature":false},{"text":"3. **No File Changes**: Report failure \"No changes detected\"","lineNumber":716,"isSignature":false},{"text":"4. **Lint Failed**: Report with lint output","lineNumber":717,"isSignature":false},{"text":"5. **Type Check Failed**: Report with typecheck output","lineNumber":718,"isSignature":false},{"text":"6. **Git Push Failed**: Report with git error","lineNumber":719,"isSignature":false},{"text":"7. **PR Creation Failed**: Report with GitHub API error","lineNumber":720,"isSignature":false},{"text":"8. **Operator API Unreachable**: Retry 5 times, then exit 1","lineNumber":721,"isSignature":false},{"text":"9. **S3 Upload Failed**: Retry 5 times with exponential backoff, then exit 1","lineNumber":722,"isSignature":false},{"text":"10. **S3 Download Failed** (on retry): Retry 5 times with exponential backoff, then exit 1","lineNumber":723,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":724,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":725,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":726,"isSignature":false},{"text":"## Testing","lineNumber":727,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":728,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Unit Tests","lineNumber":729,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":730,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- `pkg/agent/executor_test.go` - Mock agent CLI execution","lineNumber":731,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- `pkg/lint/runner_test.go` - Mock npm commands","lineNumber":732,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- `pkg/git/operations_test.go` - Mock git commands","lineNumber":733,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- `pkg/reporter/client_test.go` - Mock HTTP requests","lineNumber":734,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":735,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Integration Tests","lineNumber":736,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":737,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- End-to-end test with mock repository","lineNumber":738,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Test full workflow: clone → agent → lint → commit → push → PR → report","lineNumber":739,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":740,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":741,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":742,"isSignature":false},{"text":"## References","lineNumber":743,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":744,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- [Claude Code CLI Reference](https://docs.claude.com/ja/docs/claude-code/cli-reference)","lineNumber":745,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- [Cursor Headless CLI](https://cursor.com/ja/docs/cli/headless)","lineNumber":746,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- [ai-agent-execution.md](./ai-agent-execution.md) - Operator contract","lineNumber":747,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- [internal-api.yaml](./internal-api.yaml) - Report API specification","lineNumber":748,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":749,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":750,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":751,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Version**: 1.0.0","lineNumber":752,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Last Updated**: 2025-11-01","lineNumber":753,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.30906176567077637},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/contracts/retry-decision-tree.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":248,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":325,"column":0}},"contents":"---\n\n### Scenario G: S3 Session Download Failure (on Retry)\n\n**Flow**:\n```\n1. Operator creates new Job for retry (AgentRun.retry_count = 3)\n2. Pod starts, passes RETRY_COUNT=3 environment variable\n3. agent-runner clones repository\n4. agent-runner attempts to restore session from S3\n5. GET s3://agent-sessions/sessions/123/session.tar.gz → HTTP 503 Service Unavailable\n6. agent-runner retries with exponential backoff (5 attempts)\n7. All retries fail\n8. agent-runner logs error: \"S3 session download failed after 5 retries\"\n9. agent-runner exits with code 1 (Pod failure)\n10. Operator detects Job failure\n11. Operator does NOT increment AgentRun.retry_count (API Retry)\n12. Operator creates new Job\n13. Cycle repeats until S3 is available\n```\n\n**Retry Type**: API Retry (not counted)\n\n**Rationale**: Without session context, AI retry would be less effective. Ensure S3 is accessible before proceeding with work.\n\n---\n\n## Counting Rules\n\n### Rule 1: One Increment Per Failed Attempt\n\nEach agent execution attempt that fails for **any AI-related reason** increments `retry_count` by exactly 1.\n\n**Example**:\n```\nAttempt 1: Lint failed → retry_count = 1\nAttempt 2: Lint passed, CI failed → retry_count = 2\nAttempt 3: All passed → retry_count = 2 (no increment, success)\n```\n\n---\n\n### Rule 2: API Retries Are Transparent\n\nTransient API failures are retried automatically without incrementing `retry_count`.\n\n**Example**:\n```\nAttempt 1: GitHub API timeout → retry with backoff (3 times) → success\n           retry_count = 0 (no increment)\n```\n\n---\n\n### Rule 3: Multiple Failures in One Attempt\n\nIf multiple validations fail in a single attempt, only increment by 1.\n\n**Example**:\n```\nAttempt 1:\n  - Lint failed: 5 errors\n  - Type check failed: 2 errors\n  → increment retry_count by 1 (not 2)\n```\n\n---\n\n### Rule 4: agent-runner Retry Budget\n\nagent-runner has its own retry budget (5 attempts) for reporting to Operator API. This is **separate** from the 50 AI retries.\n\n**Example**:\n```\nAgentRun retry_count = 10\nagent-runner reports to Operator (5 API retry attempts)","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"---","lineNumber":250,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":251,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Scenario G: S3 Session Download Failure (on Retry)","lineNumber":252,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":253,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Flow**:","lineNumber":254,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":255,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. Operator creates new Job for retry (AgentRun.retry_count = 3)","lineNumber":256,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. Pod starts, passes RETRY_COUNT=3 environment variable","lineNumber":257,"isSignature":false},{"text":"3. agent-runner clones repository","lineNumber":258,"isSignature":false},{"text":"4. agent-runner attempts to restore session from S3","lineNumber":259,"isSignature":false},{"text":"5. GET s3://agent-sessions/sessions/123/session.tar.gz → HTTP 503 Service Unavailable","lineNumber":260,"isSignature":false},{"text":"6. agent-runner retries with exponential backoff (5 attempts)","lineNumber":261,"isSignature":false},{"text":"7. All retries fail","lineNumber":262,"isSignature":false},{"text":"8. agent-runner logs error: \"S3 session download failed after 5 retries\"","lineNumber":263,"isSignature":false},{"text":"9. agent-runner exits with code 1 (Pod failure)","lineNumber":264,"isSignature":false},{"text":"10. Operator detects Job failure","lineNumber":265,"isSignature":false},{"text":"11. Operator does NOT increment AgentRun.retry_count (API Retry)","lineNumber":266,"isSignature":false},{"text":"12. Operator creates new Job","lineNumber":267,"isSignature":false},{"text":"13. Cycle repeats until S3 is available","lineNumber":268,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":269,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":270,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Retry Type**: API Retry (not counted)","lineNumber":271,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":272,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Rationale**: Without session context, AI retry would be less effective. Ensure S3 is accessible before proceeding with work.","lineNumber":273,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":274,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":275,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":276,"isSignature":false},{"text":"## Counting Rules","lineNumber":277,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":278,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Rule 1: One Increment Per Failed Attempt","lineNumber":279,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":280,"isSignature":false},{"text":"Each agent execution attempt that fails for **any AI-related reason** increments `retry_count` by exactly 1.","lineNumber":281,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":282,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Example**:","lineNumber":283,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":284,"isSignature":false},{"text":"Attempt 1: Lint failed → retry_count = 1","lineNumber":285,"isSignature":false},{"text":"Attempt 2: Lint passed, CI failed → retry_count = 2","lineNumber":286,"isSignature":false},{"text":"Attempt 3: All passed → retry_count = 2 (no increment, success)","lineNumber":287,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":288,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":289,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":290,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":291,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Rule 2: API Retries Are Transparent","lineNumber":292,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":293,"isSignature":false},{"text":"Transient API failures are retried automatically without incrementing `retry_count`.","lineNumber":294,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":295,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Example**:","lineNumber":296,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":297,"isSignature":false},{"text":"Attempt 1: GitHub API timeout → retry with backoff (3 times) → success","lineNumber":298,"isSignature":false},{"text":"           retry_count = 0 (no increment)","lineNumber":299,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":300,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":301,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":302,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":303,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Rule 3: Multiple Failures in One Attempt","lineNumber":304,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":305,"isSignature":false},{"text":"If multiple validations fail in a single attempt, only increment by 1.","lineNumber":306,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":307,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Example**:","lineNumber":308,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":309,"isSignature":false},{"text":"Attempt 1:","lineNumber":310,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  - Lint failed: 5 errors","lineNumber":311,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  - Type check failed: 2 errors","lineNumber":312,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  → increment retry_count by 1 (not 2)","lineNumber":313,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":314,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":315,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":316,"isSignature