:"","lineNumber":262,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Purpose**: Detect CI pass/fail for auto-merge and AI retry","lineNumber":263,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":264,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Actions Subscribed**: `completed`","lineNumber":265,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":266,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Webhook Payload**:","lineNumber":267,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":268,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```json","lineNumber":269,"isSignature":false},{"text":"{","lineNumber":270,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  \"action\": \"completed\",","lineNumber":271,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  \"check_suite\": {","lineNumber":272,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"id\": 555666,","lineNumber":273,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"status\": \"completed\",","lineNumber":274,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"conclusion\": \"success\",","lineNumber":275,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"head_branch\": \"feature/issue-42\",","lineNumber":276,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"head_sha\": \"abc123def456\",","lineNumber":277,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"pull_requests\": [","lineNumber":278,"isSignature":false},{"text":"      {","lineNumber":279,"isSignature":false},{"text":"        \"number\": 101","lineNumber":280,"isSignature":false},{"text":"      }","lineNumber":281,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    ]","lineNumber":282,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  },","lineNumber":283,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  \"repository\": {","lineNumber":284,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"full_name\": \"octocat/hello-world\"","lineNumber":285,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  }","lineNumber":286,"isSignature":false},{"text":"}","lineNumber":287,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":288,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":289,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Conclusion Values**:","lineNumber":290,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- `success`: All checks passed","lineNumber":291,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.2951711416244507},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/contracts/github-webhooks.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":83,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":188,"column":0}},"contents":"**Purpose**: Detect dependency graph changes and trigger unblocked tasks\n\n**Actions Subscribed**: `closed`, `reopened`\n\n**Webhook Payload**:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"closed\",\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"id\": 123456,\n    \"number\": 42,\n    \"title\": \"Task A\",\n    \"body\": \"This blocks #43 and #44\",\n    \"state\": \"closed\"\n  },\n  \"repository\": {\n    \"full_name\": \"octocat/hello-world\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Processing**:\n\n1. Parse Issue body/comments for dependency keywords:\n   - \"blocked by #N\"\n   - \"depends on #N\"\n   - \"blocking #N\"\n2. Update BlockerGraphEdges table\n3. On `action: closed`:\n   - Query BlockerGraphEdges for dependents\n   - Check if all dependencies resolved\n   - Trigger new AgentRun for unblocked Issues\n4. Log dependency changes to AuditLog\n\n**Dependency Parsing Regex**:\n\n```regex\nblocked by #(\\d+)\ndepends on #(\\d+)\nblocking #(\\d+)\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. pull_request\n\nTriggered when a PR is opened, closed, or synchronized (new commits pushed).\n\n**Purpose**: Track PR status and detect merge events\n\n**Actions Subscribed**: `opened`, `synchronize`, `closed`\n\n**Webhook Payload**:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"opened\",\n  \"number\": 101,\n  \"pull_request\": {\n    \"id\": 987654,\n    \"number\": 101,\n    \"title\": \"Fix bug in parser\",\n    \"head\": {\n      \"ref\": \"feature/issue-42\"\n    },\n    \"base\": {\n      \"ref\": \"main\"\n    },\n    \"state\": \"open\",\n    \"mergeable\": true,\n    \"merged\": false,\n    \"user\": {\n      \"login\": \"github-agent-bot\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"repository\": {\n    \"full_name\": \"octocat/hello-world\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Processing**:\n\n1. Upsert PullRequest record\n2. Link to AgentRun (if created by agent)\n3. On `action: synchronize` (new commits):\n   - Reset CI status (CIStatus records)\n   - Wait for check_suite webhook\n4. On `action: closed` with `merged: true`:\n   - Update AgentRun state to succeeded\n   - Log merge event\n5. Check merge conditions (MergeConditionChecker)\n\n---\n\n### 4. pull_request_review (FR-010, FR-015)\n\nTriggered when a review is submitted on a PR.\n\n**Purpose**: Detect Codex approval for auto-merge\n\n**Webhook Payload**:","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"**Purpose**: Detect dependency graph changes and trigger unblocked tasks","lineNumber":85,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":86,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Actions Subscribed**: `closed`, `reopened`","lineNumber":87,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":88,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Webhook Payload**:","lineNumber":89,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":90,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```json","lineNumber":91,"isSignature":false},{"text":"{","lineNumber":92,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  \"action\": \"closed\",","lineNumber":93,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  \"issue\": {","lineNumber":94,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"id\": 123456,","lineNumber":95,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"number\": 42,","lineNumber":96,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"title\": \"Task A\",","lineNumber":97,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"body\": \"This blocks #43 and #44\",","lineNumber":98,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"state\": \"closed\"","lineNumber":99,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  },","lineNumber":100,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  \"repository\": {","lineNumber":101,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"full_name\": \"octocat/hello-world\"","lineNumber":102,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  }","lineNumber":103,"isSignature":false},{"text":"}","lineNumber":104,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":105,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":106,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Processing**:","lineNumber":107,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":108,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. Parse Issue body/comments for dependency keywords:","lineNumber":109,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - \"blocked by #N\"","lineNumber":110,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - \"depends on #N\"","lineNumber":111,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - \"blocking #N\"","lineNumber":112,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. Update BlockerGraphEdges table","lineNumber":113,"isSignature":false},{"text":"3. On `action: closed`:","lineNumber":114,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Query BlockerGraphEdges for dependents","lineNumber":115,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Check if all dependencies resolved","lineNumber":116,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Trigger new AgentRun for unblocked Issues","lineNumber":117,"isSignature":false},{"text":"4. Log dependency changes to AuditLog","lineNumber":118,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":119,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Dependency Parsing Regex**:","lineNumber":120,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":121,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```regex","lineNumber":122,"isSignature":false},{"text":"blocked by #(\\d+)","lineNumber":123,"isSignature":false},{"text":"depends on #(\\d+)","lineNumber":124,"isSignature":false},{"text":"blocking #(\\d+)","lineNumber":125,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":126,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":127,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":128,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":129,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### 3. pull_request","lineNumber":130,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":131,"isSignature":false},{"text":"Triggered when a PR is opened, closed, or synchronized (new commits pushed).","lineNumber":132,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":133,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Purpose**: Track PR status and detect merge events","lineNumber":134,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":135,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Actions Subscribed**: `opened`, `synchronize`, `closed`","lineNumber":136,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":137,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Webhook Payload**:","lineNumber":138,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":139,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```json","lineNumber":140,"isSignature":false},{"text":"{","lineNumber":141,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  \"action\": \"opened\",","lineNumber":142,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  \"number\": 101,","lineNumber":143,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  \"pull_request\": {","lineNumber":144,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"id\": 987654,","lineNumber":145,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"number\": 101,","lineNumber":146,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"title\": \"Fix bug in parser\",","lineNumber":147,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"head\": {","lineNumber":148,"isSignature":false},{"text":"      \"ref\": \"feature/issue-42\"","lineNumber":149,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    },","lineNumber":150,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"base\": {","lineNumber":151,"isSignature":false},{"text":"      \"ref\": \"main\"","lineNumber":152,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    },","lineNumber":153,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"state\": \"open\",","lineNumber":154,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"mergeable\": true,","lineNumber":155,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"merged\": false,","lineNumber":156,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"user\": {","lineNumber":157,"isSignature":false},{"text":"      \"login\": \"github-agent-bot\"","lineNumber":158,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    }","lineNumber":159,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  },","lineNumber":160,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  \"repository\": {","lineNumber":161,"isSignature":false},{"text":"    \"full_name\": \"octocat/hello-world\"","lineNumber":162,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  }","lineNumber":163,"isSignature":false},{"text":"}","lineNumber":164,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```","lineNumber":165,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":166,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Processing**:","lineNumber":167,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":168,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. Upsert PullRequest record","lineNumber":169,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. Link to AgentRun (if created by agent)","lineNumber":170,"isSignature":false},{"text":"3. On `action: synchronize` (new commits):","lineNumber":171,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Reset CI status (CIStatus records)","lineNumber":172,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Wait for check_suite webhook","lineNumber":173,"isSignature":false},{"text":"4. On `action: closed` with `merged: true`:","lineNumber":174,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Update AgentRun state to succeeded","lineNumber":175,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Log merge event","lineNumber":176,"isSignature":false},{"text":"5. Check merge conditions (MergeConditionChecker)","lineNumber":177,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":178,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":179,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":180,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### 4. pull_request_review (FR-010, FR-015)","lineNumber":181,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":182,"isSignature":false},{"text":"Triggered when a review is submitted on a PR.","lineNumber":183,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":184,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Purpose**: Detect Codex approval for auto-merge","lineNumber":185,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":186,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Webhook Payload**:","lineNumber":187,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.2619861364364624},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/spec.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":59,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":107,"column":0}},"contents":"1. Given 実行が started When 変更生成が成功 Then 新規ブランチとコミットが作成される\n2. Given コミットが作成済み When プッシュが成功 Then 新規 PR が作成されリンクが保存される\n\nNote (Scope Boundary): US2では失敗時の「記録・要約抽出」までを対象とし、自動再試行（retry_count増分とK8s Job再作成）はUS3で扱う。\n\n---\n\n### User Story 3 - Codex レビューと再試行 (Priority: P2)\n\n作成した PR を Codex にレビュー依頼し、戻り結果を AI にフィードバックして修正を再試\n行する。\n\n**Why this priority**: 品質向上と自動改善ループの実現。\n\n**Independent Test**: ダミーのレビュー応答を与えた場合、再実行が行われ新しいコミットが\n積み上がること。\n\n**Acceptance Scenarios**:\n1. Given PR が作成済み When システムがレビュー依頼を実行 Then PR に `@codex review` コメントが投稿され Codex サービスへのレビュー依頼が送信・記録される\n2. Given レビュー結果がある When AI に再入力 Then 追加コミットが作成される\n\n---\n\n### User Story 4 - Approve と自動マージ (Priority: P2)\n\nPR が承認状態になったら自動でマージする。\n\n**Why this priority**: フロー完結のために必要。\n\n**Independent Test**: PR に Approve を付与すると自動でマージされること。\n\n**Acceptance Scenarios**:\n1. Given PR が Approve 済み When マージ条件を満たす Then マージが成功する\n2. Given マージ要件を満たさない When 処理実行 Then マージは行われず状態が記録される\n\n---\n\n### User Story 5 - ブロック解除によるタスク再開 (Priority: P3)\n\n依存関係を持つタスクがブロックされている場合、完了によりブロックが解消されたタスクに\n自動着手する。\n\n**Why this priority**: 継続的な自動推進。\n\n**Independent Test**: 依存関係グラフでブロック解消時に次タスク実行が開始されること。\n\n**Acceptance Scenarios**:\n1. Given タスクB がタスクA に依存 When タスクA が完了 Then タスクB の実行が開始される","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"1. Given 実行が started When 変更生成が成功 Then 新規ブランチとコミットが作成される","lineNumber":60,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. Given コミットが作成済み When プッシュが成功 Then 新規 PR が作成されリンクが保存される","lineNumber":61,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":62,"isSignature":false},{"text":"Note (Scope Boundary): US2では失敗時の「記録・要約抽出」までを対象とし、自動再試行（retry_count増分とK8s Job再作成）はUS3で扱う。","lineNumber":63,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":64,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":65,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":66,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### User Story 3 - Codex レビューと再試行 (Priority: P2)","lineNumber":67,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":68,"isSignature":false},{"text":"作成した PR を Codex にレビュー依頼し、戻り結果を AI にフィードバックして修正を再試","lineNumber":69,"isSignature":false},{"text":"行する。","lineNumber":70,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":71,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Why this priority**: 品質向上と自動改善ループの実現。","lineNumber":72,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":73,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Independent Test**: ダミーのレビュー応答を与えた場合、再実行が行われ新しいコミットが","lineNumber":74,"isSignature":false},{"text":"積み上がること。","lineNumber":75,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":76,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Acceptance Scenarios**:","lineNumber":77,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. Given PR が作成済み When システムがレビュー依頼を実行 Then PR に `@codex review` コメントが投稿され Codex サービスへのレビュー依頼が送信・記録される","lineNumber":78,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. Given レビュー結果がある When AI に再入力 Then 追加コミットが作成される","lineNumber":79,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":80,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":81,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":82,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### User Story 4 - Approve と自動マージ (Priority: P2)","lineNumber":83,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":84,"isSignature":false},{"text":"PR が承認状態になったら自動でマージする。","lineNumber":85,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":86,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Why this priority**: フロー完結のために必要。","lineNumber":87,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":88,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Independent Test**: PR に Approve を付与すると自動でマージされること。","lineNumber":89,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":90,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Acceptance Scenarios**:","lineNumber":91,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. Given PR が Approve 済み When マージ条件を満たす Then マージが成功する","lineNumber":92,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. Given マージ要件を満たさない When 処理実行 Then マージは行われず状態が記録される","lineNumber":93,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":94,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":95,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":96,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### User Story 5 - ブロック解除によるタスク再開 (Priority: P3)","lineNumber":97,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":98,"isSignature":false},{"text":"依存関係を持つタスクがブロックされている場合、完了によりブロックが解消されたタスクに","lineNumber":99,"isSignature":false},{"text":"自動着手する。","lineNumber":100,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":101,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Why this priority**: 継続的な自動推進。","lineNumber":102,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":103,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Independent Test**: 依存関係グラフでブロック解消時に次タスク実行が開始されること。","lineNumber":104,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":105,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Acceptance Scenarios**:","lineNumber":106,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. Given タスクB がタスクA に依存 When タスクA が完了 Then タスクB の実行が開始される","lineNumber":107,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.25545668601989746},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/spec.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":152,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":180,"column":0}},"contents":"- FR-019: コミットと push はオペレーター（自動実行主体）側で実行する。Git pre-commit / pre-push フック等による失敗は最大 50 回の自動再試行に含め、無限待機は不可とし、上限・キャンセル条件を設けて失敗時は通知する (MUST)\n\n- FR-020: 同一ブランチに対するエージェント実行は同時に 1 件のみ許可する（per-branch concurrency = 1）(MUST)\n- FR-021: PR/ブランチ単位の操作はロックを取得して実行し、重複操作（PR 作成、コメント投稿、レビュー依頼、マージ）を防止する (MUST)\n- FR-022: 再試行には総経過時間上限および各試行のタイムアウトを設定し、いずれかの上限到達時は失敗として扱う (MUST)\n- FR-023: データストアは MySQL を使用し、データアクセスは GORM を用い、マイグレーションは goose を用いる (MUST)\n- FR-024: 依存関係は GitHub Issue の blocked by / blocking フィールドを一次情報として利用する (MUST)\n\n### Webhook Events (authoritative)\n\n- issue_comment\n  - Purpose: `/run-agent` トリガ検知、`@codex review` による再レビュー依頼\n  - Actions: 投稿者の書き込み権限検証、AgentRun のキュー投入、必要に応じてレビュー依頼コメント投稿\n  - Idempotency: X-GitHub-Delivery + operation_id（comment-id ベース）\n  - FR refs: FR-001, FR-009, FR-010, FR-017\n\n- pull_request\n  - Purpose: PR の open/synchronize/closed を観測し、リンク・マージ結果を反映\n  - Actions: PR リンクの保存、merge 検知、merge 後の後続タスク起動\n  - FR refs: FR-003, FR-006, FR-021\n\n- pull_request_review\n  - Purpose: Codex からの approve を検知（Bot ID 検証 or Reviews API state=APPROVED）\n  - Actions: マージ条件の再評価、CI 成功時の自動マージ試行\n  - FR refs: FR-011, FR-015\n\n- pull_request_review_comment\n  - Purpose: PR 上の `@codex review` 検知による再レビュー依頼トリガ","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"- FR-019: コミットと push はオペレーター（自動実行主体）側で実行する。Git pre-commit / pre-push フック等による失敗は最大 50 回の自動再試行に含め、無限待機は不可とし、上限・キャンセル条件を設けて失敗時は通知する (MUST)","lineNumber":153,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":154,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- FR-020: 同一ブランチに対するエージェント実行は同時に 1 件のみ許可する（per-branch concurrency = 1）(MUST)","lineNumber":155,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- FR-021: PR/ブランチ単位の操作はロックを取得して実行し、重複操作（PR 作成、コメント投稿、レビュー依頼、マージ）を防止する (MUST)","lineNumber":156,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- FR-022: 再試行には総経過時間上限および各試行のタイムアウトを設定し、いずれかの上限到達時は失敗として扱う (MUST)","lineNumber":157,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- FR-023: データストアは MySQL を使用し、データアクセスは GORM を用い、マイグレーションは goose を用いる (MUST)","lineNumber":158,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- FR-024: 依存関係は GitHub Issue の blocked by / blocking フィールドを一次情報として利用する (MUST)","lineNumber":159,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":160,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Webhook Events (authoritative)","lineNumber":161,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":162,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- issue_comment","lineNumber":163,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  - Purpose: `/run-agent` トリガ検知、`@codex review` による再レビュー依頼","lineNumber":164,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  - Actions: 投稿者の書き込み権限検証、AgentRun のキュー投入、必要に応じてレビュー依頼コメント投稿","lineNumber":165,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  - Idempotency: X-GitHub-Delivery + operation_id（comment-id ベース）","lineNumber":166,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  - FR refs: FR-001, FR-009, FR-010, FR-017","lineNumber":167,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":168,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- pull_request","lineNumber":169,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  - Purpose: PR の open/synchronize/closed を観測し、リンク・マージ結果を反映","lineNumber":170,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  - Actions: PR リンクの保存、merge 検知、merge 後の後続タスク起動","lineNumber":171,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  - FR refs: FR-003, FR-006, FR-021","lineNumber":172,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":173,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- pull_request_review","lineNumber":174,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  - Purpose: Codex からの approve を検知（Bot ID 検証 or Reviews API state=APPROVED）","lineNumber":175,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  - Actions: マージ条件の再評価、CI 成功時の自動マージ試行","lineNumber":176,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  - FR refs: FR-011, FR-015","lineNumber":177,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":178,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- pull_request_review_comment","lineNumber":179,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  - Purpose: PR 上の `@codex review` 検知による再レビュー依頼トリガ","lineNumber":180,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.25005894899368286},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"internal/repositories/pull_request.go","range":{"startPosition":{"line":63,"column":68},"endPosition":{"line":92,"column":1}},"contents":"func (r *PullRequestRepository) UpdateMergeable(id int, mergeable bool) error {\n\treturn r.db.Model(&models.PullRequest{}).Where(\"id = ?\", id).Update(\"mergeable\", mergeable).Error\n}\n\n// Upsert inserts or updates a PullRequest based on repo+number uniqueness.\n// If a PR with the same repo and number exists, it updates the specified fields;\n// otherwise, a new record is created.\n//\n// Fields updated on conflict: issue_id, branch, base_branch, status, mergeable, updated_at\n// Fields preserved on update: id, repo, number, created_at\n//\n// Returns error if database operation fails (e.g., unique constraint violation, connection error)\nfunc (r *PullRequestRepository) Upsert(pr *models.PullRequest) error {\n\t// Use GORM's clause.OnConflict to handle upsert based on unique constraint (repo, number)\n\treturn r.db.Clauses(clause.OnConflict{\n\t\tColumns: []clause.Column{\n\t\t\t{Name: \"repo\"},\n\t\t\t{Name: \"number\"},\n\t\t},\n\t\tDoUpdates: clause.AssignmentColumns([]string{\n\t\t\t\"issue_id\",\n\t\t\t\"branch\",\n\t\t\t\"base_branch\",\n\t\t\t\"status\",\n\t\t\t\"mergeable\",\n\t\t\t\"updated_at\",\n\t\t}),\n\t}).Create(pr).Error\n}","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"func (r *PullRequestRepository) UpdateMergeable(id int, mergeable bool) error {","lineNumber":65,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\treturn r.db.Model(&models.PullRequest{}).Where(\"id = ?\", id).Update(\"mergeable\", mergeable).Error","lineNumber":66,"isSignature":false},{"text":"}","lineNumber":67,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":68,"isSignature":false},{"text":"// Upsert inserts or updates a PullRequest based on repo+number uniqueness.","lineNumber":69,"isSignature":false},{"text":"// If a PR with the same repo and number exists, it updates the specified fields;","lineNumber":70,"isSignature":false},{"text":"// otherwise, a new record is created.","lineNumber":71,"isSignature":false},{"text":"//","lineNumber":72,"isSignature":false},{"text":"// Fields updated on conflict: issue_id, branch, base_branch, status, mergeable, updated_at","lineNumber":73,"isSignature":false},{"text":"// Fields preserved on update: id, repo, number, created_at","lineNumber":74,"isSignature":false},{"text":"//","lineNumber":75,"isSignature":false},{"text":"// Returns error if database operation fails (e.g., unique constraint violation, connection error)","lineNumber":76,"isSignature":false},{"text":"func (r *PullRequestRepository) Upsert(pr *models.PullRequest) error {","lineNumber":77,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t// Use GORM's clause.OnConflict to handle upsert based on unique constraint (repo, number)","lineNumber":78,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\treturn r.db.Clauses(clause.OnConflict{","lineNumber":79,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\tColumns: []clause.Column{","lineNumber":80,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\t\t{Name: \"repo\"},","lineNumber":81,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\t\t{Name: \"number\"},","lineNumber":82,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\t},","lineNumber":83,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\tDoUpdates: clause.AssignmentColumns([]string{","lineNumber":84,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\t\t\"issue_id\",","lineNumber":85,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\t\t\"branch\",","lineNumber":86,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\t\t\"base_branch\",","lineNumber":87,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\t\t\"status\",","lineNumber":88,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\t\t\"mergeable\",","lineNumber":89,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\t\t\"updated_at\",","lineNumber":90,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\t}),","lineNumber":91,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t}).Create(pr).Error","lineNumber":92,"isSignature":false},{"text":"}","lineNumber":93,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.23910200595855713},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/spec.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":141,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":155,"column":0}},"contents":"  決定する (MUST)\n- FR-013: 依存関係に反する実行（下流先行など）が検出された場合は当該実行を保留にし、\n  ブロック解除イベントで再開する (MUST)\n\n  注記: グローバルには無制限並行実行（FR-012）とするが、per-branch concurrency=1（FR-020）と PR/ブランチ単位のロック（FR-021）を適用して重複操作を防止する。\n\n- FR-014: CI 結果は GitHub Webhook で受領し、失敗時は CI ログ要約/レビュー指摘をAIに再入力して最大50回まで自動修正再試行を行う。50回超えは失敗扱いとし、GitHub IssueおよびDiscord Webhookに失敗通知を送る (MUST)\n- FR-015: Codex ボットによる承認（コメント/レビュー）が PR に投稿・統合された時点で、マージ条件を再評価し、自動でマージを試行する。原則イベント駆動（ポーリング不要）だが、必要に応じて限定的にポーリングを使用してよい。対象イベント（issue_comment, pull_request, pull_request_review, check_suite/check_run/status, push）は適時明確化する (MUST)\n- FR-016: 外部 API 呼び出しの再試行は、指数バックオフ+ジッターを用い設定した最大リトライ回数まで実施し、上限到達時は失敗として扱う (MUST)\n- FR-017: 冪等化キーに X-GitHub-Delivery を用い、同一 Delivery ID のイベントは一度のみ処理する。加えて、各操作（pr-create, post-comment, request-review, merge）に operation_id を付与し、操作レベルでも冪等に実行して重複を防止する (MUST)\n- FR-018: 認可は「リポジトリのCollaborator以上」のユーザーのみに限定する (MUST)\n- FR-019: コミットと push はオペレーター（自動実行主体）側で実行する。Git pre-commit / pre-push フック等による失敗は最大 50 回の自動再試行に含め、無限待機は不可とし、上限・キャンセル条件を設けて失敗時は通知する (MUST)\n\n- FR-020: 同一ブランチに対するエージェント実行は同時に 1 件のみ許可する（per-branch concurrency = 1）(MUST)","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"  決定する (MUST)","lineNumber":142,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- FR-013: 依存関係に反する実行（下流先行など）が検出された場合は当該実行を保留にし、","lineNumber":143,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  ブロック解除イベントで再開する (MUST)","lineNumber":144,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":145,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  注記: グローバルには無制限並行実行（FR-012）とするが、per-branch concurrency=1（FR-020）と PR/ブランチ単位のロック（FR-021）を適用して重複操作を防止する。","lineNumber":146,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":147,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- FR-014: CI 結果は GitHub Webhook で受領し、失敗時は CI ログ要約/レビュー指摘をAIに再入力して最大50回まで自動修正再試行を行う。50回超えは失敗扱いとし、GitHub IssueおよびDiscord Webhookに失敗通知を送る (MUST)","lineNumber":148,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- FR-015: Codex ボットによる承認（コメント/レビュー）が PR に投稿・統合された時点で、マージ条件を再評価し、自動でマージを試行する。原則イベント駆動（ポーリング不要）だが、必要に応じて限定的にポーリングを使用してよい。対象イベント（issue_comment, pull_request, pull_request_review, check_suite/check_run/status, push）は適時明確化する (MUST)","lineNumber":149,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- FR-016: 外部 API 呼び出しの再試行は、指数バックオフ+ジッターを用い設定した最大リトライ回数まで実施し、上限到達時は失敗として扱う (MUST)","lineNumber":150,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- FR-017: 冪等化キーに X-GitHub-Delivery を用い、同一 Delivery ID のイベントは一度のみ処理する。加えて、各操作（pr-create, post-comment, request-review, merge）に operation_id を付与し、操作レベルでも冪等に実行して重複を防止する (MUST)","lineNumber":151,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- FR-018: 認可は「リポジトリのCollaborator以上」のユーザーのみに限定する (MUST)","lineNumber":152,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- FR-019: コミットと push はオペレーター（自動実行主体）側で実行する。Git pre-commit / pre-push フック等による失敗は最大 50 回の自動再試行に含め、無限待機は不可とし、上限・キャンセル条件を設けて失敗時は通知する (MUST)","lineNumber":153,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":154,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- FR-020: 同一ブランチに対するエージェント実行は同時に 1 件のみ許可する（per-branch concurrency = 1）(MUST)","lineNumber":155,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.22638340294361115},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/tasks.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":375,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":427,"column":0}},"contents":"```\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Strategy\n\n### MVP First (User Stories 1 + 2 Only)\n\n1. Complete Phase 1: Setup (7 tasks)\n2. Complete Phase 2: Foundational (17 tasks) - CRITICAL foundation with GORM + goose\n3. Complete Phase 3: User Story 1 (10 tasks)\n4. Complete Phase 4: User Story 2 (11 tasks)\n5. **STOP and VALIDATE**: Test end-to-end flow from comment to PR\n6. Deploy to staging environment\n\n**MVP Value**: Automated PR creation from Issue comments - immediate productivity gain\n\n### Incremental Delivery\n\n1. **Foundation** (Phase 1+2): 24 tasks → GORM + goose, webhooks, core infrastructure ready\n2. **MVP** (+US1+US2): 21 tasks → Comment triggers AI agent, creates PR automatically\n3. **Quality Loop** (+US3): 14 tasks → Automatic improvements via Codex review + CI retry (max 50)\n4. **Full Automation** (+US4): 10 tasks → Auto-merge on approval - zero human intervention\n5. **Dependency Management** (+US5): 11 tasks → Sequential task execution with blocking\n6. **Production Ready** (+Polish): 14 tasks → Monitoring, docs, security hardening\n\nTotal: 94 tasks (comparable scope using GORM + goose)\n\n### Parallel Team Strategy\n\nWith multiple developers after Foundational phase:\n\n1. **Team completes Phase 1+2 together** (24 tasks, foundational with GORM + goose)\n2. **Split work:**\n   - Developer A: User Story 1 (webhook triggers)\n   - Developer B: User Story 2 (AI + PR creation) - can work with stub from US1\n   - Developer C: User Story 5 (dependency graph) - completely independent\n3. **Sequential enhancements:**\n   - Developer B continues to US3 (review loop) after US2\n   - Developer B continues to US4 (auto-merge) after US3\n4. **Final integration:** Merge all stories, test interactions\n5. **Polish together:** Phase 8 can be parallelized across team\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- **[P] tasks**: Different files, no dependencies - safe to parallelize\n- **[Story] labels**: Map tasks to user stories from spec.md for traceability\n- **GORM**: Type-safe database access with ORM (T008-T010)\n- **Idempotency**: Every webhook handler uses X-GitHub-Delivery for deduplication (T024)\n- **Retry logic**: All external API calls use exponential backoff utility (T022)","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"```","lineNumber":376,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":377,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":378,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":379,"isSignature":false},{"text":"## Implementation Strategy","lineNumber":380,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":381,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### MVP First (User Stories 1 + 2 Only)","lineNumber":382,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":383,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. Complete Phase 1: Setup (7 tasks)","lineNumber":384,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. Complete Phase 2: Foundational (17 tasks) - CRITICAL foundation with GORM + goose","lineNumber":385,"isSignature":false},{"text":"3. Complete Phase 3: User Story 1 (10 tasks)","lineNumber":386,"isSignature":false},{"text":"4. Complete Phase 4: User Story 2 (11 tasks)","lineNumber":387,"isSignature":false},{"text":"5. **STOP and VALIDATE**: Test end-to-end flow from comment to PR","lineNumber":388,"isSignature":false},{"text":"6. Deploy to staging environment","lineNumber":389,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":390,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**MVP Value**: Automated PR creation from Issue comments - immediate productivity gain","lineNumber":391,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":392,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Incremental Delivery","lineNumber":393,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":394,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. **Foundation** (Phase 1+2): 24 tasks → GORM + goose, webhooks, core infrastructure ready","lineNumber":395,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. **MVP** (+US1+US2): 21 tasks → Comment triggers AI agent, creates PR automatically","lineNumber":396,"isSignature":false},{"text":"3. **Quality Loop** (+US3): 14 tasks → Automatic improvements via Codex review + CI retry (max 50)","lineNumber":397,"isSignature":false},{"text":"4. **Full Automation** (+US4): 10 tasks → Auto-merge on approval - zero human intervention","lineNumber":398,"isSignature":false},{"text":"5. **Dependency Management** (+US5): 11 tasks → Sequential task execution with blocking","lineNumber":399,"isSignature":false},{"text":"6. **Production Ready** (+Polish): 14 tasks → Monitoring, docs, security hardening","lineNumber":400,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":401,"isSignature":false},{"text":"Total: 94 tasks (comparable scope using GORM + goose)","lineNumber":402,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":403,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Parallel Team Strategy","lineNumber":404,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":405,"isSignature":false},{"text":"With multiple developers after Foundational phase:","lineNumber":406,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":407,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. **Team completes Phase 1+2 together** (24 tasks, foundational with GORM + goose)","lineNumber":408,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. **Split work:**","lineNumber":409,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Developer A: User Story 1 (webhook triggers)","lineNumber":410,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Developer B: User Story 2 (AI + PR creation) - can work with stub from US1","lineNumber":411,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Developer C: User Story 5 (dependency graph) - completely independent","lineNumber":412,"isSignature":false},{"text":"3. **Sequential enhancements:**","lineNumber":413,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Developer B continues to US3 (review loop) after US2","lineNumber":414,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Developer B continues to US4 (auto-merge) after US3","lineNumber":415,"isSignature":false},{"text":"4. **Final integration:** Merge all stories, test interactions","lineNumber":416,"isSignature":false},{"text":"5. **Polish together:** Phase 8 can be parallelized across team","lineNumber":417,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":418,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":419,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":420,"isSignature":false},{"text":"## Notes","lineNumber":421,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":422,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- **[P] tasks**: Different files, no dependencies - safe to parallelize","lineNumber":423,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- **[Story] labels**: Map tasks to user stories from spec.md for traceability","lineNumber":424,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- **GORM**: Type-safe database access with ORM (T008-T010)","lineNumber":425,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- **Idempotency**: Every webhook handler uses X-GitHub-Delivery for deduplication (T024)","lineNumber":426,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- **Retry logic**: All external API calls use exponential backoff utility (T022)","lineNumber":427,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.22436314821243286},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/data-model.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":0,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":59,"column":0}},"contents":"# data-model.md: GitHub Agent Automation データモデル\n\n**Last Updated**: 2025-10-31\n**Database**: MySQL 8.0+ with GORM (Go)\n**Schema Location**: GORM models in `internal/models`, SQL migrations in `migrations/` (goose)\n\n## エンティティ定義・属性\n\n### Issue\n- id: INT (PK, auto-increment)\n- repo: STRING (e.g., \"owner/repo-name\")\n- number: INT (GitHub Issue number)\n- github_issue_id: BIGINT UNSIGNED (numeric GitHub Issue ID)\n- title: STRING\n- body: TEXT (nullable)\n- labels: JSON (array of label names)\n- state: ENUM(open/closed)\n- created_at: DATETIME\n- updated_at: DATETIME\n\n**Relationships**:\n- has many AgentRun (one Issue can trigger multiple runs)\n- has many BlockerGraphEdges (as task or dependent task)\n\n**Indexes**:\n- UNIQUE(repo, number) - prevent duplicate Issue records\n\n### PullRequest\n- id: INT (PK, auto-increment)\n- repo: STRING\n- number: INT (GitHub PR number)\n- issue_id: INT (FK to Issue.id, nullable) - **NEW**: tracks which Issue triggered this PR\n- branch: STRING (e.g., \"feature/issue-123\")\n- base_branch: STRING (e.g., \"main\", default: \"main\")\n- status: ENUM(open/closed/merged)\n- mergeable: BOOL (nullable) - **NEW**: GitHub mergeable status\n- created_at: DATETIME\n- updated_at: DATETIME\n\n**Relationships**:\n- has many ReviewFeedback\n- has many CIStatus\n- belongs to Issue (optional, via issue_id)\n- has many AgentRun (one PR can have multiple retry attempts)\n\n**Indexes**:\n- UNIQUE(repo, number)\n- INDEX(issue_id) - for querying PRs by Issue\n\n### AgentRun\n- id: INT (PK, auto-increment)\n- idempotency_key: STRING (UK) - **X-GitHub-Delivery header for deduplication**\n- issue_id: INT (FK to Issue.id) - **NEW**: which Issue is being processed\n- pr_id: INT (FK to PullRequest.id, nullable) - PR created by this run\n- state: ENUM(queued/started/succeeded/failed)\n- agent_type: ENUM(claude-code/cursor-agent) - **NEW**: Which AI agent was used\n- input: JSON (Issue context, comments, dependencies, **manifest config**)\n- output: JSON (AI agent response, changes made)\n- retry_count: INT (default: 0, max: 50)","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"# data-model.md: GitHub Agent Automation データモデル","lineNumber":1,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":2,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Last Updated**: 2025-10-31","lineNumber":3,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Database**: MySQL 8.0+ with GORM (Go)","lineNumber":4,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Schema Location**: GORM models in `internal/models`, SQL migrations in `migrations/` (goose)","lineNumber":5,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":6,"isSignature":false},{"text":"## エンティティ定義・属性","lineNumber":7,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":8,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Issue","lineNumber":9,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- id: INT (PK, auto-increment)","lineNumber":10,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- repo: STRING (e.g., \"owner/repo-name\")","lineNumber":11,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- number: INT (GitHub Issue number)","lineNumber":12,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- github_issue_id: BIGINT UNSIGNED (numeric GitHub Issue ID)","lineNumber":13,"isSignature":false},