block auto-merge\n4. Review audit logs: `SELECT * FROM audit_logs WHERE event_type = 'merge.attempted'`\n\n---\n\n## Deployment\n\n### Docker Deployment\n\n```bash\n# Build image\ndocker build -t github-agent-automation:latest .\n\n# Run container\ndocker run -d \\\n  --name agent-automation \\\n  --env-file .env \\\n  -p 3000:3000 \\\n  github-agent-automation:latest\n```\n\n### Docker Compose\n\n```yaml\n# docker-compose.yml\nversion: '3.8'\nservices:\n  app:\n    build: .\n    ports:\n      - \"3000:3000\"\n    env_file:\n      - .env\n    depends_on:\n      - mysql\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\n  mysql:\n    image: mysql:8.0\n    environment:\n      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: root_password\n      MYSQL_DATABASE: github_agent_automation\n      MYSQL_USER: agent_user\n      MYSQL_PASSWORD: secure_password\n    volumes:\n      - mysql_data:/var/lib/mysql\n    ports:\n      - \"3306:3306\"\n\nvolumes:\n  mysql_data:\n```\n\nRun with:\n```bash\ndocker-compose up -d\n```\n\n### Agent Runner Docker Image\n\nThe `agent-runner` component runs as a Kubernetes Pod and requires a Docker image to be built and pushed to a container registry.\n\n#### Automatic Build and Push (GitHub Actions)\n\nWhen code is pushed to the `master` branch, GitHub Actions automatically builds and pushes the Docker image to GitHub Container Registry (ghcr.io):\n\n- Image: `ghcr.io/<OWNER>/agent-runner:latest`\n- Image (with SHA): `ghcr.io/<OWNER>/agent-runner:sha-<SHORT_SHA>`\n\nThe build job runs automatically on every push to master. No manual action required.\n\n#### Manual Build and Push\n\nTo manually build and push the agent-runner Docker image:\n\n```bash\n# Build the image (creates both latest and sha-<SHA> tags)","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"3. Ensure `ReviewFeedback.approval_detected` is being set","lineNumber":480,"isSignature":false},{"text":"4. Review logs for regex matching errors","lineNumber":481,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":482,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Issue: PR not auto-merging","lineNumber":483,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":484,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Solution**:","lineNumber":485,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. Check all merge conditions (see data-model.md):","lineNumber":486,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - CI passed (all CIStatus.conclusion = 'success')","lineNumber":487,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - Codex approved (ReviewFeedback.approval_detected = true)","lineNumber":488,"isSignature":false},{"text":"   - No conflicts (PullRequest.mergeable = true)","lineNumber":489,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. Verify GitHub App has write permission on PRs","lineNumber":490,"isSignature":false},{"text":"3. Check branch protection rules don't block auto-merge","lineNumber":491,"isSignature":false},{"text":"4. Review audit logs: `SELECT * FROM audit_logs WHERE event_type = 'merge.attempted'`","lineNumber":492,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":493,"isSignature":false},{"text":"---","lineNumber":494,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":495,"isSignature":false},{"text":"## Deployment","lineNumber":496,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":497,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Docker Deployment","lineNumber":498,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":499,"isSignature":false},{"text":"```bash","lineNumber":500,"isSignature":false},{"text":"# Build image","lineNumber":501,"isSignature":false},{"text":"docker build -t github-agent-automation:latest .","lineNumber":502,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":503,"isSignature":false},{"text":"# Run container","lineNumber":504,"isSignature":false},{"text":"docker run -d \\","lineNumber":505,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  --name agent-automation \\","lineNumber":506,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  --env-file .env \\","lineNumber":507,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  -p 3000:3000 \\","lineNumber":508,"isSignature":false},{"text":"  github-agent-automation:latest","lineNumber":509,"isSignature":false