y (T022)\n- **Max 50 retries**: Enforced in RetryOrchestrator (T052, T055)\n- **Notifications**: Dual channel (GitHub + Discord) for all failures (FR-008, FR-014)\n- **Authorization**: Collaborator+ check in every webhook handler (FR-018, T028)\n- **DoD**: CI success + Codex approve + no conflicts (SC-009)\n\n### Success Criteria Mapping\n\n- SC-001 (2min to start): US1 webhook processing + K8s Job creation (T053, T055)\n- SC-002 (15min to PR): agent-runner execution in Pod (T030-T048)\n- SC-003 (10min retry): US3 feedback loop + K8s Job re-creation (T113-T081)\n- SC-004 (no duplicates): Idempotency middleware (T024)\n- SC-005 (5min unblock): US5 blocker resolution (T126-T128)\n- SC-006 (5min CI retry): US3 check_suite handler (T111-T112)\n- SC-007 (2min merge): US4 auto-merge (T111)\n- SC-008 (immediate notification): US3 failure notifications (T083-T084)\n- SC-009 (DoD conditions): US4 merge checker (T108)\n\n### Edge Cases Addressed\n\n- Duplicate webhooks: T024 idempotency middleware\n- Review response missing: T113 retry orchestrator with timeout\n- Merge conflicts: T110 conflict detector blocks auto-merge\n- Unlimited concurrency: No locking (運用側考慮 per FR-012)\n- Circular dependencies: T124 cycle detector prevents deadlock\n- Rate limits: T135 rate limiting for GitHub API\n- Database queries: T140, T146 optimize with SQL indexes (goose)\n- Operator API unreachable: agent-runner exponential backoff retry (T038, T047)\n\n### GORM Model Highlights\n\n```go\ntype AgentRun struct {\n  IdempotencyKey string `gorm:\"uniqueIndex\"` // X-GitHub-Delivery\n  RetryCount     int    `gorm:\"default:0\"`   // Max 50\n  State          string // queued/started/succeeded/failed\n  // ... other fields\n}\n\ntype BlockerGraphEdge struct {\n  TaskID          int `gorm:\"primaryKey\"`\n  DependsOnTaskID int `gorm:\"primaryKey\"`\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n**Total Tasks**: 147 tasks organized across 8 phases","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"- **Idempotency**: Every webhook handler uses X-GitHub-Delivery for deduplication (T024)","lineNumber":426,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- **Retry logic**: All external API calls use exponential backoff utility (T022)","lineNumber":427,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- **Max 50 retries**: Enforced in RetryOrchestrator (T052, T055)","lineNumber":428,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- **Notifications**: Dual channel (GitHub + Discord) for all failures (FR-008, FR-014)","lineNumber":429,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- **Authorization**: Collaborator+ check in every webhook handler (FR-018, T028)","lineNumber":430,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- **DoD**: CI success + Codex approve + no conflicts (SC-009)","lineNumber":431,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":432,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Success Criteria Mapping","lineNumber":433,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":434,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- SC-001 (2min to start): US1 webhook processing + K8s Job creation (T053, T055)","lineNumber":435,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- SC-002 (15min to PR): agent-runner execution in Pod (T030-T048)","lineNumber":436,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- SC-003 (10min retry): US3 feedback loop + K8s Job re-creation (T113-T081)","lineNumber":437,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- SC-004 (no duplicates): Idempotency middleware (T024)","lineNumber":438,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- SC-005 (5min unblock): US5 blocker resolution (T126-T128)","lineNumber":439,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- SC-006 (5min CI retry): US3 check_suite handler (T111-T112)","lineNumber":440,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- SC-007 (2min merge): US4 auto-merge (T111)","lineNumber":441,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- SC-008 (immediate notification): US3 failure notifications (T083-T084)","lineNumber":442,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- SC-009 (DoD conditions): US4 merge checker (T108)","lineNumber":443,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":444,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Edge Cases Addressed","lineNumber":445,"isSign