e":false},{"text":"\tresult := r.db.Where(\"depends_on_task_id = ?\", issueID).Find(&edges)","lineNumber":120,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\tif result.Error != nil {","lineNumber":121,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\treturn nil, result.Error","lineNumber":122,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t}","lineNumber":123,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":124,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t// Return empty slice instead of nil","lineNumber":125,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\tif edges == nil {","lineNumber":126,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t\tedges = []models.BlockerGraphEdge{}","lineNumber":127,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\t}","lineNumber":128,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":129,"isSignature":false},{"text":"\treturn edges, nil","lineNumber":130,"isSignature":false},{"text":"}","lineNumber":131,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":132,"isSignature":false},{"text":"// GetAllEdges returns all edges in the blocker graph","lineNumber":133,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.45014119148254395},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/research.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":254,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":322,"column":0}},"contents":"**Decision**: State machine with retry counter\n\n**Implementation**:\n- AgentRun.retryCount: increment on each AI retry\n- Max retries: 50 (FR-014)\n- On failure: aggregate CI logs + review comments\n- Pass to AI agent as context for next iteration\n- After 50 attempts: set state=failed, notify GitHub + Discord\n\n### 4.4 Dependency Graph Management\n\n**Decision**: Adjacency list in BlockerGraphEdges table\n\n**Algorithm**:\n- On Issue close: query dependents (tasks blocked by this Issue)\n- Check if all dependencies resolved for each dependent\n- If yes: trigger execution for unblocked tasks\n- Cycle detection: DFS with visited set (warn but don't block)\n\n**Data Model**:\n- Composite PK: (taskId, dependsOnTaskId)\n- Both columns FK to Issue.id\n- Parse \"blocked by #123\" from Issue body using regex\n\n### 4.5 Concurrent Execution\n\n**Decision**: No locking, rely on Git merge conflicts\n\n**Rationale**:\n- Spec requires unlimited concurrency (FR-012)\n- File conflicts detected at PR merge time\n- Simpler than distributed locks\n- User resolves conflicts or closes duplicate Issues\n\n**Risk Mitigation**: Document in quickstart.md that users should manage Issue dependencies\n\n## 5. Performance & Scalability\n\n### 5.1 Rate Limiting\n\n**GitHub API**: 5000 requests/hour for authenticated apps\n- Implement request counter in MetricsService\n- Warn at 80% threshold (4000 req/hr)\n- Backoff if rate limit exceeded\n\n**Codex API**: TBD - implement per-API documentation\n\n### 5.2 Database Optimization\n\n- Index on AgentRun.idempotencyKey (unique)\n- Index on AgentRun.state for querying active runs\n- Index on BlockerGraphEdges.dependsOnTaskId for dependency lookup\n- Index on CIStatus.prId for CI result queries\n- Connection pooling: GORM default (sql.DB with SetMaxOpenConns, SetMaxIdleConns)\n\n### 5.3 Observability\n\n**Metrics**:\n- Webhook processing time (p50, p95, p99)\n- Agent execution time\n- Retry counts per Issue\n- GitHub API request count\n- Success/failure rates\n\n**Logging**:\n- All webhook events (DEBUG level)\n- All external API calls (INFO level)\n- Errors with stack traces (ERROR level)","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"**Decision**: State machine with retry counter","lineNumber":255,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":256,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Implementation**:","lineNumber":257,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- AgentRun.retryCount: increment on each AI retry","lineNumber":258,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Max retries: 50 (FR-014)","lineNumber":259,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- On failure: aggregate CI logs + review comments","lineNumber":260,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Pass to AI agent as context for next iteration","lineNumber":261,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- After 50 attempts: set state=failed, notify GitHub + Discord","lineNumber":262,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":263,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### 4.4 Dependency Graph Management","lineNumber":264,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":265,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Decision**: Adjacency list in BlockerGraphEdges table","lineNumber":266,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":267,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Algorithm**:","lineNumber":268,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- On Issue close: query dependents (tasks blocked by this Issue)","lineNumber":269,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Check if all dependencies resolved for each dependent","lineNumber":270,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- If yes: trigger execution for unblocked tasks","lineNumber":271,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Cycle detection: DFS with visited set (warn but don't block)","lineNumber":272,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":273,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Data Model**:","lineNumber":274,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Composite PK: (taskId, dependsOnTaskId)","lineNumber":275,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Both columns FK to Issue.id","lineNumber":276,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Parse \"blocked by #123\" from Issue body using regex","lineNumber":277,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":278,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### 4.5 Concurrent Execution","lineNumber":279,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":280,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Decision**: No locking, rely on Git merge conflicts","lineNumber":281,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":282,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Rationale**:","lineNumber":283,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Spec requires unlimited concurrency (FR-012)","lineNumber":284,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- File conflicts detected at PR merge time","lineNumber":285,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Simpler than distributed locks","lineNumber":286,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- User resolves conflicts or closes duplicate Issues","lineNumber":287,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":288,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Risk Mitigation**: Document in quickstart.md that users should manage Issue dependencies","lineNumber":289,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":290,"isSignature":false},{"text":"## 5. Performance & Scalability","lineNumber":291,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":292,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### 5.1 Rate Limiting","lineNumber":293,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":294,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**GitHub API**: 5000 requests/hour for authenticated apps","lineNumber":295,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Implement request counter in MetricsService","lineNumber":296,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Warn at 80% threshold (4000 req/hr)","lineNumber":297,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Backoff if rate limit exceeded","lineNumber":298,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":299,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Codex API**: TBD - implement per-API documentation","lineNumber":300,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":301,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### 5.2 Database Optimization","lineNumber":302,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":303,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Index on AgentRun.idempotencyKey (unique)","lineNumber":304,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Index on AgentRun.state for querying active runs","lineNumber":305,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Index on BlockerGraphEdges.dependsOnTaskId for dependency lookup","lineNumber":306,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Index on CIStatus.prId for CI result queries","lineNumber":307,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Connection pooling: GORM default (sql.DB with SetMaxOpenConns, SetMaxIdleConns)","lineNumber":308,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":309,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### 5.3 Observability","lineNumber":310,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":311,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Metrics**:","lineNumber":312,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Webhook processing time (p50, p95, p99)","lineNumber":313,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Agent execution time","lineNumber":314,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Retry counts per Issue","lineNumber":315,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- GitHub API request count","lineNumber":316,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Success/failure rates","lineNumber":317,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":318,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Logging**:","lineNumber":319,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- All webhook events (DEBUG level)","lineNumber":320,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- All external API calls (INFO level)","lineNumber":321,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Errors with stack traces (ERROR level)","lineNumber":322,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.4321151077747345},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/tasks.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":256,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":286,"column":0}},"contents":"- [ ] T122 [P] [US5] Create directed graph data structure for dependencies in internal/utils/dependency_graph.go\n- [ ] T123 [US5] Implement blocker graph builder from Issue metadata in internal/services/blocker_graph.go\n- [ ] T124 [US5] Create circular dependency detector with cycle detection algorithm in internal/services/circular_dependency_detector.go\n- [ ] T125 [US5] Implement webhook handler for issues events (closed/reopened) in internal/webhooks/handlers/issues.go\n- [ ] T126 [US5] Create blocked task resolver finding unblocked tasks in internal/services/blocked_task.go\n- [ ] T127 [US5] Implement dependency validation preventing out-of-order execution in internal/services/dependency_validator.go\n- [ ] T128 [US5] Implement automatic K8s Job trigger for unblocked tasks in internal/services/blocked_task.go\n- [ ] T129 [US5] Add GitHub status comment for dependency violations in internal/services/github_notification.go\n- [ ] T130 [US5] Add logging for blocker graph updates and task resumption in internal/services/blocked_task.go\n\n### Tests for User Story 5 (Test-First Development)\n\n- [ ] T131 [P] [US5] Write unit tests for IssueBlockerParser (dependency parsing)\n- [ ] T132 [P] [US5] Write unit tests for CircularDependencyDetector (cycle detection)\n- [ ] T133 [US5] Write integration test for Issue close → unblock → auto-trigger flow\n\n**Checkpoint**: All user stories should now be independently functional - complete system with dependency management\n\n---\n\n## Phase 8: Polish & Cross-Cutting Concerns\n\n**Purpose**: Improvements that affect multiple user stories\n\n- [ ] T134 [P] Add comprehensive error messages and user-facing error codes in internal/utils/error_codes.go\n- [ ] T135 [P] Implement rate limiting for GitHub API calls in internal/clients/github.go\n- [ ] T136 [P] Add metrics collection for execution times and success rates in internal/services/metrics.go\n- [ ] T137 [P] Create health check endpoint for webhook server in internal/webhooks/server.go\n- [ ] T138 [P] Add environment variable validation on startup in internal/config/env.go\n- [ ] T139 [P] Implement graceful shutdown handler in internal/webhooks/server.go","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"- [ ] T122 [P] [US5] Create directed graph data structure for dependencies in internal/utils/dependency_graph.go","lineNumber":257,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- [ ] T123 [US5] Implement blocker graph builder from Issue metadata in internal/services/blocker_graph.go","lineNumber":258,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- [ ] T124 [US5] Create circular dependency detector with cycle detection algorithm in internal/services/circular_dependency_detector.go","lineNumber":259,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- [ ] T125 [US5] Implement webhook handler for issues events (closed/reopened) in internal/webhooks/handlers/issues.go","lineNumber":260,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- [ ] T126 [US5] Create blocked task resolver finding unblocked tasks in internal/services/blocked_task.go","lineNumber":261,"isSignat