rror codes in internal/utils/error_codes.go","lineNumber":281,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- [ ] T135 [P] Implement rate limiting for GitHub API calls in internal/clients/github.go","lineNumber":282,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- [ ] T136 [P] Add metrics collection for execution times and success rates in internal/services/metrics.go","lineNumber":283,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- [ ] T137 [P] Create health check endpoint for webhook server in internal/webhooks/server.go","lineNumber":284,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- [ ] T138 [P] Add environment variable validation on startup in internal/config/env.go","lineNumber":285,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- [ ] T139 [P] Implement graceful shutdown handler in internal/webhooks/server.go","lineNumber":286,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.4237067997455597},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/data-model.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":344,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":394,"column":0}},"contents":"- Send Discord notification (embed with error history)\n- Stop auto-retry loop\n- Manual re-trigger available via CLI with `--reset-count` flag\n\n### PullRequest Merge Conditions (Definition of Done)\n\nA PR can be auto-merged when ALL of the following are true:\n\n1. **CI Success**: All CIStatus records have conclusion=success\n2. **Codex Approval**: At least one ReviewFeedback has approval_detected=true\n3. **No Conflicts**: PullRequest.mergeable=true (from GitHub API)\n4. **Status**: PullRequest.status=open\n\n**Checking Strategy**:\n- Re-evaluate on every check_suite.completed webhook\n- Re-evaluate on every Codex review comment webhook\n- Use MergeConditionChecker service to validate all conditions\n- Call AutoMergeService if conditions met\n\n### BlockerGraph Dependencies\n\n**Dependency Resolution**:\n- Task Y is blocked if EXISTS BlockerGraphEdges WHERE task_id=Y AND depends_on_task_id IN (open Issues)\n- Task Y is unblocked when ALL dependencies have Issue.state=closed\n- On Issue close: query BlockerGraphEdges to find newly unblocked tasks\n- Trigger new AgentRun for each unblocked task\n\n**Cycle Detection**:\n- Run DFS before starting execution\n- If cycle detected: log warning, add to AuditLog, notify in GitHub comment\n- Do NOT block execution (spec allows human resolution)\n\n## 制約情報（MySQL/GORM）\n\n### Unique Constraints\n- Issue: UNIQUE(repo, number)\n- PullRequest: UNIQUE(repo, number)\n- AgentRun: UNIQUE(idempotency_key)\n- CIStatus: UNIQUE(pr_id, check_suite_id, check_run_id)\n- BlockerGraphEdges: PRIMARY KEY(task_id, depends_on_task_id)\n\n### Foreign Key Constraints\n- AgentRun.issue_id → Issue.id (ON DELETE CASCADE)\n- AgentRun.pr_id → PullRequest.id (ON DELETE SET NULL)\n- PullRequest.issue_id → Issue.id (ON DELETE SET NULL)\n- ReviewFeedback.pr_id → PullRequest.id (ON DELETE CASCADE)\n- CIStatus.pr_id → PullRequest.id (ON DELETE CASCADE)\n- BlockerGraphEdges.task_id → Issue.id (ON DELETE CASCADE)\n- BlockerGraphEdges.depends_on_task_id → Issue.id (ON DELETE CASCADE)","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"- Send Discord notification (embed with error history)","lineNumber":345,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Stop auto-retry loop","lineNumber":346,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Manual re-trigger available via CLI with `--reset-count` flag","lineNumber":347,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":348,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### PullRequest Merge Conditions (Definition of Done)","lineNumber":349,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":350,"isSignature":false},{"text":"A PR can be auto-merged when ALL of the following are true:","lineNumber":351,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":352,"isSignature":false},{"text":"1. **CI Success**: All CIStatus records have conclusion=success","lineNumber":353,"isSignature":false},{"text":"2. **Codex Approval**: At least one ReviewFeedback has approval_detected=true","lineNumber":354,"isSignature":false},{"text":"3. **No Conflicts**: PullRequest.mergeable=true (from GitHub API)","lineNumber":355,"isSignature":false},{"text":"4. **Status**: PullRequest.status=open","lineNumber":356,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":357,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Checking Strategy**:","lineNumber":358,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Re-evaluate on every check_suite.completed webhook","lineNumber":359,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Re-evaluate on every Codex review comment webhook","lineNumber":360,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Use MergeConditionChecker service to validate all conditions","lineNumber":361,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Call AutoMergeService if conditions met","lineNumber":362,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":363,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### BlockerGraph Dependencies","lineNumber":364,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":365,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Dependency Resolution**:","lineNumber":366,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Task Y is blocked if EXISTS BlockerGraphEdges WHERE task_id=Y AND depends_on_task_id IN (open Issues)","lineNumber":367,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Task Y is unblocked when ALL dependencies have Issue.state=closed","lineNumber":368,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- On Issue close: query BlockerGraphEdges to find newly unblocked tasks","lineNumber":369,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Trigger new AgentRun for each unblocked task","lineNumber":370,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":371,"isSignature":false},{"text":"**Cycle Detection**:","lineNumber":372,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Run DFS before starting execution","lineNumber":373,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- If cycle detected: log warning, add to AuditLog, notify in GitHub comment","lineNumber":374,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Do NOT block execution (spec allows human resolution)","lineNumber":375,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":376,"isSignature":false},{"text":"## 制約情報（MySQL/GORM）","lineNumber":377,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":378,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Unique Constraints","lineNumber":379,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- Issue: UNIQUE(repo, number)","lineNumber":380,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- PullRequest: UNIQUE(repo, number)","lineNumber":381,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- AgentRun: UNIQUE(idempotency_key)","lineNumber":382,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- CIStatus: UNIQUE(pr_id, check_suite_id, check_run_id)","lineNumber":383,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- BlockerGraphEdges: PRIMARY KEY(task_id, depends_on_task_id)","lineNumber":384,"isSignature":false},{"text":"","lineNumber":385,"isSignature":false},{"text":"### Foreign Key Constraints","lineNumber":386,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- AgentRun.issue_id → Issue.id (ON DELETE CASCADE)","lineNumber":387,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- AgentRun.pr_id → PullRequest.id (ON DELETE SET NULL)","lineNumber":388,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- PullRequest.issue_id → Issue.id (ON DELETE SET NULL)","lineNumber":389,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- ReviewFeedback.pr_id → PullRequest.id (ON DELETE CASCADE)","lineNumber":390,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- CIStatus.pr_id → PullRequest.id (ON DELETE CASCADE)","lineNumber":391,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- BlockerGraphEdges.task_id → Issue.id (ON DELETE CASCADE)","lineNumber":392,"isSignature":false},{"text":"- BlockerGraphEdges.depends_on_task_id → Issue.id (ON DELETE CASCADE)","lineNumber":393,"isSignature":false}]},"score":0.3766457140445709},{"codeBlock":{"relativeWorkspacePath":"specs/001-github-agent-automation/tasks.md","range":{"startPosition":{"line":284,"column":0},"endPosition":{"line":323,"column":0}},"contents":"- [ ] T138 [P] Add environment variable validation on startup in internal/config/env.go\n- [ ] T139 [P] Implement graceful shutdown handler in internal/webhooks/server.go\n- [ ] T140 [P] Add/optimize SQL indexes via goose migrations in `migrations/*.sql`\n- [ ] T141 [P] Create README.md with setup and deployment instructions\n- [ ] T142 [P] Document API client configurations in docs/api-clients.md\n- [ ] T143 [P] Add inline code documentation with Go doc comments\n- [ ] T144 Run quickstart.md validation checklist\n- [ ] T145 Perform security audit for secret handling and authorization\n- [ ] T146 [P] Add performance optimization for blocker graph queries with SQL indexes (goose)\n- [ ] T147 [P] Implement caching for GitHub API responses where appropriate\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies & Execution Order\n\n### Phase Dependencies\n\n- **Setup (Phase 1)**: No dependencies - can start immediately\n- **Foundational (Phase 2)**: Depends on Setup completion - BLOCKS all user stories\n- **User Story 1 (Phase 3)**: Depends on Foundational phase completion\n- **User Story 2 (Phase 4)**: Depends on Foundational phase completion + integrates with US1\n- **User Story 3 (Phase 5)**: Depends on Foundational phase completion + requires US2 PR creation\n- **User Story 4 (Phase 6)**: Depends on Foundational phase completion + requires US2 PR + US3 reviews\n- **User Story 5 (Phase 7)**: Depends on Foundational phase completion + can work independently\n- **Polish (Phase 8)**: Depends on all desired user stories being complete\n\n### User Story Dependencies\n\n- **User Story 1 (P1)**: Can start after Foundational (Phase 2) - No dependencies on other stories\n- **User Story 2 (P1)**: Requires US1 trigger mechanism, builds on top of it\n- **User Story 3 (P2)**: Requires US2 PR creation to have something to review\n- **User Story 4 (P2)**: Requires US2 PRs and US3 review results to evaluate merge conditions\n- **User Story 5 (P3)**: Can start after Foundational (Phase 2) - Independent, manages execution order\n\n**Note**: US1 and US5 are relatively independent; US2→US3→US4 form a sequential enhancement chain.\n\n### Within Each User Story\n\n- Models before services (repositories depend on models)","signatures":{"ranges":[]},"detailedLines":[{"text":"- [ ] T138 [P] Add environment variable validation on startup in internal/config/env.go","lineNumber":285,"isSignature":